WEBVTT

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:02.936
So therefore, you need to make sure
that that person who is speaking,

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.416
that sponsor,

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.696
has your best interests at heart

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:10.776
and has the power to get it,
whatever it is for you,

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.216
to get it done behind closed doors.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.896
Now, I'm asked all the time,

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.976
"How do you get one?"

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:24.136
Well, frankly, nirvana is when
someone sees you in an environment

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:27.216
and decides, "I'm going
to make it happen for you.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.016
I'm going to make sure
that you are successful."